00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:08.720
This was also made in an era where networks
were producing 24 episodes a season, right.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.620
It's just not tenable for anything.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.720
It's crazy that people used to do that.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.230
Tighten it up.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:18.280
Be specific with what you're doing from world
to world to world.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.590
Get a great cast.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:21.240
Get a good budget.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:26.150
You've got a really good show that has a premise
that can go on for as long as it needs to

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:29.210
but also doesn't have to go on that long at
all.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:32.810
I think that could be really fun.

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:33.810
That's my pick.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:40.560
Now Brian, if you don't mind my asking, would
you please reenact the theme song from Sliders?

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:47.120
Wasn't it like, (scatting) Wasn't it something
like that?

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.120
I don't remember.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.120
I honestly don't remember.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:53.320
I remember the little logo would pop up and
go, Sliders.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.320
That's all I remember.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.320
That's what I was looking for.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:58.720
I hope our audience is happy to know that
this is the video they can watch if they want

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:02.730
to watch Tom slowly die inside as Brian and
I talk.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.930
I feel like I'm staring into the dark crystal
right now.

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:09.010
What else did you want us to say?

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.090
If not Tru Calling-

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.010
He just wanted us all to say Farscape and
then go home.

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.010
That's what he wants.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:15.670
I also said Farscape.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:21.820
I've put my soul out on a chopping board and
then I let you guys cut it up into little

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:22.820
pieces.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.440
Nina, what was the Tru Calling theme song?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.000
It was like somebody save.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.510
It was like one of those Evanescence knockoff
kind of things.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.170
Is the Smallville?

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:36.060
It was indistinguishable.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.490
I looked up the opening credits and I was
like, this sounds like Smallville written

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.130
by Evanescence and I turned it off.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:45.600
Tom, do you remember the Farscape theme song
because I do.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:48.230
Do you want to hear it?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:52.170
The Farscape theme song said like your most
obnoxious friends sings Rick and Morty theme

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:55.540
song at karaoke when they're already like
half a bottle of tequila in.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:59.560
It's just this like wailing way too big.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.290
Do you want to play it ?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.290
No.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.290
Cause I thought it was-

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.290
We can't play it.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:08.510
It was Farscape.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.800
Going to Farscape.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:16.620
We're on a Farscape out here in space.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:17.830
Muppets in space.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.100
It was really, really good.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:25.770
I'm going to go learn an actual trade skill.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:29.300
I'll see you around.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.960
Love you guys.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:32.960
Love you too.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.640
Do you guys want to watch Tru Calling?

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:35.640
No.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.030
I just want to die.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:40.440
Thanks for watching.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:41.440
